From 8f19afe01c68860a30bef766e8c1c7e5f096e3e4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Keel <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 22:31:19 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] Appearance dialog: show colour and opacity live on the picked
 objects

The opacity slider, colour picker and surface settings changed nothing visible until Apply or OK.
Each change now shows on the picked bodies or faces at once: it goes back to a checkpoint taken
before the first change and applies the new look, so the history holds one step. OK keeps it,
Cancel (or Escape) goes back to the checkpoint and leaves no step. Apply and Remove override
work as before.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
